# Every interface comes up on DHCP.
#
# An appliance is plugged into a segment somebody else runs, and asking them to
# assign it an address before it can start recording is asking them to do work
# during the incident that made them plug it in. It records whether or not it
# gets a lease: the netlink and packet collectors need no address at all.

auto lo
iface lo inet loopback

auto eth0
iface eth0 inet dhcp
